{"id":9148,"date":"2020-04-21T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2020-04-21T06:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/maximizing-parent-participation-during-telehealth-services-video\/"},"modified":"2024-10-03T17:42:50","modified_gmt":"2024-10-03T21:42:50","slug":"maximizing-parent-participation-during-telehealth-services-video","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/maximizing-parent-participation-during-telehealth-services-video\/","title":{"rendered":"Maximizing Parent Participation during Telehealth Services"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9148\" class=\"elementor elementor-9148\" data-elementor-post-type=\"resources\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-12c0c513 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"12c0c513\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-14a072fe\" data-id=\"14a072fe\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-260dc0d4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"260dc0d4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Presenter:<\/strong> Bridget A. Taylor, PsyD, BCBA-D and Executive Director of Alpine Learning Group<\/p>\n<p><strong>Recorded On:<\/strong> Thursday, April 16th, 2020<\/p>\n<p>During these unprecedented times, behavior analysts are now engaging families in service delivery via various web-based platforms. In order to upkeep standard of care, it is imperative to have an effective process in place.<\/p>\n<p>This webinar will review:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Best practices when training parents remotely<\/li>\n<li>Processes for helping families develop meaningful goal selection for both themselves and their children<\/li>\n<li>Suggestions for providing compassionate care in our training of caregivers and helping family members develop self-compassion in their work with their children<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>We will also review components of Rethink&#8217;s curriculum for potential skills to target within the home environment.<\/p>\n<p><strong>An open question and answer period will follow the presentation.<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":15025,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: Maximize Parent Participation Telehealth Services","_seopress_titles_desc":"Best practices when training parents remotely, Processes for helping families develop meaningful goal selection for both themselves and their children.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[86],"resource-tag":[],"class_list":["post-9148","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-tips-tools-tech"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/9148","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\